+## Native provenance binding conformance
+
+The WOS-owned native custody rule is specified in `wos-trellis-verification.md` WOS-TV-028. Its controlled positive vector is `fixtures/conformance/native-provenance-routing.json`; adapter and offline tests cover the unknown-kind/canonical-bypass/strict-CBOR negatives. These checks preserve Core's semantic boundary and do not qualify actual D1 history. The generic event must appear in both admission dispatch and catalog metadata.
